# FRQ_SEQ  1.4   Format version 2023.06.03
#
#  Frequency sequence used for Kokee/Fortleza fringe test
#
#  Astronomical convention is used for band definition
#  For instance notation 2004.1 32.0 means the band
#  that covers range [2004.1, 2036.1] MHz
#
#  Last updated by L. Petrov on 2026.07.24_10:03:06
#
HDS_NAME  kk1
MOD_NAME  k03
#
STATION KOKEE     KK  kk_02
#
# Band  Low_frq bandwidh Sub
#
BAND B  2225.99  8.0   dir
BAND B  2239.99  8.0   dir
BAND B  2255.99  8.0   dir
BAND B  2271.99  8.0   dir
BAND B  2279.99  8.0   dir
BAND B  2287.99  8.0   dir
#
BAND A  8204.99  8.0   dir
BAND A  8212.99  8.0   dir
BAND A  8252.99  8.0   dir
BAND A  8352.99  8.0   dir
BAND A  8512.99  8.0   dir
#
BAND C  8732.99  8.0   dir
BAND C  8852.99  8.0   dir
BAND C  8912.99  8.0   dir
BAND C  8924.99  8.0   dir
BAND C  8932.99  8.0   dir
#
#    bnd  lo    low_freq high_freq
#
RANGE A 8100.0  8600.0   9100.0
RANGE B 7600.0  8100.0   8600.0
RANGE C 1500.0  2100.0   2400.0
